  lines:
  - Good, finding clues helps you build the case.
  - Pressing TAB will bring up the list of clues that you've found. These can then
    later be used as evidence to help solve the case.
  - Click on the Interrogate button on the left to question me about evidence you've
    found.
  - After interrogating me, continue to the next room.
